WHAT MATCHTIME SAID TO THEM:
NOW: Tuesday 10 November 2026, 18:00 (club time, London)
MATCHTIME'S RECENT MESSAGES TO THEM: none in the last 14 days.

The player (Zed) asks:
what time is kick off?

