Exactly these five keys, one object, nothing after it. \\"intro\\" is [] for every intent but \\"intro_messages\\", and \\"club_ref\\" is \\"\\" for every intent but \\"approve_club\\" and \\"reject_club\\".","cache_control":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Their clubs: Sutton FC (player, live)\\nSender: Someone\\nNOW: Wednesday 4 November 2026, 12:00 (club time, London)\\nMATCHTIME'S RECENT MESSAGES TO THEM: none in the last 14 days.\\nTHE DM:\\nIN"}]}",
