- Average rating: — (squad avg —)
- Man of the Match: 0
- Record: 0W 0D 0L
- Form (last 5): — (steady)

YOUR PAYMENTS (this player's own; you know nothing about anyone else's payments):
- Money collector: Kemal
- Ways to pay: pay by bank, card, pay Kemal directly
- Upcoming match's fee: not confirmed yet. The usual fee is £6 per player; the money collector confirms it after the game.
- No played matches of yours to pay for.

## Recent History
Completed matches: 1 total. Use this block as the source of truth for ANY historical question — MoM winners, scores, attendance, current form. Never invent numbers; if the answer isn't here, say "I don't have that one yet" rather than guessing.

Completed matches (oldest first):
  - 3 Kasım 2026 Salı: no score recorded | MoM: no votes yet

Attendance leaderboard (CONFIRMED appearances out of every completed match — denominator is total matches, so a late-joining player who has played every match since is fairly ranked below an ever-present):
  1. Player 1 — 1/1 (100%)
