      "replyText": "🛠️ *MatchTime in your admin group*
Tag me in every message here: type *@* and pick *Match Time* from the list. Typing my name or replying to my message is not enough. Then ask in your own words, for example:

🖼️ *"@Match Time send the poster"*, *"@Match Time team sheet please"*: the list or the teams as a graphic, ready to forward.
🌙 *"@Match Time turn on quiet hours from 23:00 to 09:00"*, *"@Match Time turn off quiet hours"*: I hold my own messages overnight, or send at any time. A new club starts with quiet hours off.
👥 *"@Match Time we play with 12 to 16"*, *"@Match Time we can play with 12"*: the fewest and most you play with. I only warn you about low numbers, or offer to cancel, below the fewest, and when two are waiting on the bench I suggest going up a size. *"@Match Time back to full teams"* undoes the fewest.
🔁 *"@Match Time make it 8 a side"*, *"@Match Time 6 a side on Monday"*: one game a different size, inside those numbers. Going up, the bench moves in; going down, the last to join go to the bench. Each is told by DM, and I post the new list.

ℹ️ Ask me how any part works, and how to switch it on or off, in your own words: for example *@Match Time how do partner clubs work?* or *@Match Time where are the settings?*
Ask *@Match Time what can you do?* here any time to see this again.",
